00152: {"assertion_index":150,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L151","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":151,"full_assertion":"| WANDERINGSPIRIT | 实际接触，U 能力可获得且非 RECEIVER/WONDERGUARD；接触许可才交换 U/T 身份。其后无论是否交换都 U 失去 → T 失去 → U 获得 → T 获得；无统一 U 存活前门，许可本身会拒倒下 U |"}
00153: {"assertion_index":151,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L152","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":152,"full_assertion":"| WATERCOMPACTION | 本次水类型，请求 T 防御 +2 |"}
00154: {"assertion_index":152,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L153","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":153,"full_assertion":"| WEAKARMOR | 物理招且至少可自降防或自升速；先防 −1，再速度世代 ≥ 7 +2、旧世代 +1，逐项资格、可部分成功 |"}
00155: {"assertion_index":153,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L155","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":155,"full_assertion":"OnDealingHit 唯一 POISONTOUCH：原始接触且 r < 30，T 有效 SHIELDDUST 且模式破坏者假则阻止；否则 T 可中毒才普通毒。没有用 U 接触许可或实际接触查询替代该条件，U 能力调用虽允许濒死，T 中央状态门仍拒倒下。每击可分别抽；不是整次招式只抽一次。"}
00156: {"assertion_index":154,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L171","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":171,"full_assertion":"| BEASTBOOST | 对侧队伍未全灭，目标列表中 damageState.fainted 数量 n > 0；取 U 未算阶级的五项数值最高者，按攻 → 防 → 特攻 → 特防 → 速遇并列取首个。若该项可升则 +n，即使已封顶也不改选下一项 |"}
00157: {"assertion_index":155,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L173","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":173,"full_assertion":"| CHILLINGNEIGH／ASONECHILLINGNEIGH | 同样门，攻击只 +1（不是 +n）；临时把能力标识设 CHILLINGNEIGH 展示/执行后恢复传入身份 |"}
00158: {"assertion_index":156,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L174","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":174,"full_assertion":"| GRIMNEIGH／ASONEGRIMNEIGH | 同上但特攻 +1 及临时 GRIMNEIGH 身份 |"}
00159: {"assertion_index":157,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L175","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":175,"full_assertion":"| MAGICIAN | 非未来攻击、是伤害招、U 无物且非野生拥有者；按目标列表找非 unaffected/非替身且有可转移物品者。双方不可失去物品门；T 有效 STICKYHOLD 拒该目标但可继续下个，没有模式破坏者例外。首个成功物转 U、T 清，T 轻装有效时标记；野生战且 U 还原记录空、转物等于 T 还原物时转移两份还原记录；U 持物触发后结束扫描 |"}
00160: {"assertion_index":158,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L172","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":172,"full_assertion":"| MOXIE | 同样对侧未全灭且 n > 0，攻击 +n |"}
00161: {"assertion_index":159,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L183","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":183,"full_assertion":"AfterMoveUseFromTarget：BERSERK 要求伤害招、跨半标记仍真、中央可升，特攻 +1；COLORCHANGE 要求本次 calcDamage 非 0、非替身、类型非空且非伪类型、T 尚非单一该类型，改成该类型并清多余类型；PICKPOCKET 要求 T 非野生、U 未换出、原始接触、U 当前替身无且 T 本击非替身、T 无物且 U 有可转物、双方不可失去门；U 有效 STICKYHOLD 阻止，无模式破坏者例外。成功物转 T、U 清、U 轻装标记，野生战符合空还原/原物条件则转还原记录，最后 T 持物触发。"}
00162: {"assertion_index":160,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L197","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":197,"full_assertion":"| EndOfRoundWeather DRYSKIN | 天气期限先到期/恢复默认后，逐成员在普通天气伤害前用其有效天气：晴且可受间伤扣总 HP 整除 8，再恢复物品；雨且 canHeal 请求总 HP 整除 8 恢复 |"}
00163: {"assertion_index":161,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L198","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":198,"full_assertion":"| 同族 ICEBODY／RAINDISH | 有效冰雹/雨且可恢复时分别总 HP 整除 16；其它天气无效 |"}
00164: {"assertion_index":162,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers-L191","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers.md","line":191,"full_assertion":"| DISGUISE／ICEFACE、DAMP、PROTEAN／LIBERO、PARENTALBOND、MAGICBOUNCE、MOLDBREAKER／TERAVOLT／TURBOBLAZE | 命令/《战斗类型、命中与伤害计算》已有前门与阶段；生命周期/受击直接分支见阶段触发规格，完整形态与招式域见《Mega、Primal 与显式还原》/《多次攻击、特殊伤害与恢复》/招式变更规格。没有把这些当未登记＝无效果 |"}
00165: {"assertion_index":163,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L200","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":200,"full_assertion":"| 同族 ICEFACE | 输入有效冰雹、允许恢复标记真且形态 1，请求形态 0；该处理器本身不再加物种门，标记建立在具名 EISCUE 天气检查 |"}
00166: {"assertion_index":164,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L240","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":240,"full_assertion":"| ICEFACE | EISCUE 形态 1、身份 ICEFACE、有效冰雹且天气检查不是「能力改变」时置可恢复标记；回合末/入场恢复见前表，不能把天气通知等同当场立刻恢复 |"}
00167: {"assertion_index":165,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L250","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":250,"full_assertion":"| DISGUISE／ICEFACE 吸收 | WP43：替身更早；模式破坏者假、对应物种及形态 0，冰脸还要求物理。原能力身份查询不套普通有效。后续画皮改 1，世代 ≥ 8 扣总 HP 整除 8；冰脸改 1。计算伤害哨兵与实际 hpLost 分别记账 |"}
00168: {"assertion_index":166,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L199","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":199,"full_assertion":"| 同族 SOLARPOWER | 有效晴且可受间伤，扣总 HP 整除 8 后恢复物品 |"}
00169: {"assertion_index":167,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L201","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":201,"full_assertion":"| EndOfRoundHealing HEALER | 在青草治疗之后、同成员回血物品之前，一次 r < 30 成功后遍历全部存活盟友，治各自真实异常；不是每盟友独立 30%，无异常者跳过 |"}
00170: {"assertion_index":168,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L202","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":202,"full_assertion":"| 同族 HYDRATION | 自己有真实异常且有效雨，治疗 |"}
00171: {"assertion_index":169,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L203","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":203,"full_assertion":"| 同族 SHEDSKIN | 自己有真实异常再抽 r < 30，治疗；不是三分之一 |"}
00172: {"assertion_index":170,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L204","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":204,"full_assertion":"| EndOfRoundEffect BADDREAMS | 侧/场期限和场地到期后的后段；逐邻近存活对侧「视为睡眠」者，可受间伤则经效果伤害过程扣总 HP 整除 8，可嵌套物品、退出、濒死；不等同只对真实睡眠 |"}
00173: {"assertion_index":171,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L205","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":205,"full_assertion":"| 同族 MOODY | 世代 ≥ 8 候选五项主战斗阶级，旧世代七项含命中闪避；分别收集中央可升/可自降集合。均空不做；均匀选可升一项请求 +2，再从预先可降集合删除同项，均匀选剩可降一项 −1。可只升或只降；剩可降集合非空才检查阶级恢复物品，随后总会检查降阶退出物品 |"}
00174: {"assertion_index":172,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L206","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":206,"full_assertion":"| 同族 SPEEDBOOST | 在场 turnCount > 0、选择非 Run 且可升速度，+1；本轮开始后才入场者 turnCount 0 不升 |"}
00175: {"assertion_index":173,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L207","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":207,"full_assertion":"| EndOfRoundGainItem BALLFETCH | 同成员后段能力 → 后段物品 → 取物能力顺序。自身空物且全局首个未回收球记录非空，取该物；自身还原记录空才补，清全局球记录，持物触发 |"}
00176: {"assertion_index":174,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L208","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":208,"full_assertion":"| 同族 HARVEST | 空物、回收记录为树果；晴免抽，其它 r < 50；取树果、清回收记录、空还原记录才补，持物触发 |"}
00177: {"assertion_index":175,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L209","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":209,"full_assertion":"| 同族 PICKUP | 空物；扫描其它存活场上者的 PickupUse，选严格大于当前最大且最大 > 0 者（并列保留先见），最后选出的 PickupItem 非空才取；清来源拾取物/序号、同物回收记录；野生战符合空还原/原物相等条件时转还原记录；持物触发 |"}
00178: {"assertion_index":176,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers-L179","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers.md","line":179,"full_assertion":"换出保证族 CertainSwitching 本快照**无登记**。TrappingByTarget：ARENATRAP 对非浮空候选真；MAGNETPULL 对钢类型真；SHADOWTAG 对候选没有有效同能力时真。它们只提供阻止资格，不执行换人，也不替代换人规格的仅换入/组合检查/界面/登记/执行分层。逃跑保证 RUNAWAY 返回真，真实调用仍先拒训练家战、玩家不可逃设置；幽灵特例、道具、局部束缚和实际速度逃跑分支按换人规格。RUNAWAY 不是换出保证，不把逃跑处理器投射到替补选择。"}
00179: {"assertion_index":177,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers-L226","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers.md","line":226,"full_assertion":"| TrappingByTarget（3） | ARENATRAP、MAGNETPULL、SHADOWTAG | §7 |"}
00180: {"assertion_index":178,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers-L192","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers.md","line":192,"full_assertion":"| MAGICGUARD、AIRLOCK／CLOUDNINE、雨/晴强天气等 | 《异常状态、能力阶级与免疫》/场域规格、战斗结果主阶段与阶段触发规格；§2 的有效天气是其结果输入 |"}
00181: {"assertion_index":179,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L051","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":51,"full_assertion":"| AIRLOCK／CLOUDNINE | 展示天气影响消失，不清当前天气/期限；有效天气压制由 WP45 查询负责 |"}
00182: {"assertion_index":180,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L054","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":54,"full_assertion":"| ANTICIPATION | 仅玩家拥有者；扫描存活对侧伤害招。基于基础相性（无效跳过），有克制或三种 OHKO 效果则提示；无自身类型时只 OHKO。世代 ≥ 6 的觉醒力量按对方个体 IV 取类型，其余用招式原类型，不跑完整本次命中/伤害 |"}
00183: {"assertion_index":181,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L053","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":53,"full_assertion":"| ASONECHILLINGNEIGH／ASONEGRIMNEIGH | 先复合能力提示，再临时把场上能力标识改 UNNERVE 作提示，随后恢复原身份；不构造任意多能力系统 |"}
00184: {"assertion_index":182,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers-L187","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/pokemon-rules/wp48-ability-calculation-modifiers.md","line":187,"full_assertion":"| DARKAURA／FAIRYAURA／AURABREAK | 《战斗类型、命中与伤害计算》§6.3：匹配暗/妖精的全局气场在本表前使 P ×4/3，有破坏者改 ×3/4，不因多个同气场重复乘 |"}
00185: {"assertion_index":183,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L052","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":52,"full_assertion":"| AURABREAK、DARKAURA、FAIRYAURA、MOLDBREAKER、PRESSURE、TERAVOLT、TURBOBLAZE、UNNERVE、COMATOSE | 此回调仅对应能力/气场/紧张感/瞌睡提示，实际数值、耗 PP 或视为睡眠在各主规则；COMATOSE 此提示本身没有物种门 |"}
00186: {"assertion_index":184,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L063","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":63,"full_assertion":"| CURIOUSMEDICINE | 存活盟友有非零阶级时逐个重置全部七阶级，正负均归 0；不重置自己，不逐项模拟升降触发 |"}
00187: {"assertion_index":185,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L064","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":64,"full_assertion":"| DAUNTLESSSHIELD／INTREPIDSWORD | 分别请求自身防御 +1/攻击 +1，经中央资格；没有每场一次标记 |"}
00188: {"assertion_index":186,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L075","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":75,"full_assertion":"DRIZZLE/DROUGHT/SANDSTREAM/SNOWWARNING 分别请求雨/晴/沙暴/冰雹；同当前天气不刷新期限，普通能力不能覆盖强天气。DELTASTREAM/DESOLATELAND/PRIMORDIALSEA 分别强风/大日照/大雨，可走覆盖强天气入口。普通天气默认固定 5 回合并可由有效延长物品改变；关闭能力固定天气配置时无限，强天气本来无限。WP45 主规格给建立、覆盖、有效压制和失去拥有者时默认恢复的完整规则。"}
00189: {"assertion_index":187,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L065","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":65,"full_assertion":"| DOWNLOAD | 求存活对侧的当前防御与特防数值各总和（数值读取受奇妙空间交换，非含阶级计算）；防总和 < 特防总和则攻 +1，否则特攻 +1，空集合 0 = 0 也选择特攻 |"}
00190: {"assertion_index":188,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L077","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":77,"full_assertion":"ELECTRICSURGE/GRASSYSURGE/MISTYSURGE/PSYCHICSURGE 分别电/青草/薄雾/精神场地；已有同场地不刷新，否则建立默认 5 并允许有效延长物品。建立时全场能力通知一遍，再全场物品通知一遍，不按每成员能力 → 物品交错。MIMICRY 入场仅当前场地非无时调用其场地合同（§8），不加接地门。"}
00191: {"assertion_index":189,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L057","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":57,"full_assertion":"FOREWARN 也只玩家拥有者：扫描对侧每个招式，按以下「比较分数」选最大并均匀抽取并列条目之一展示名称；同名多条不去重，不执行伤害计算。默认取数据威力；OHKO 三类设 160；反击/镜面反射/金属爆炸设 120；固定 20/40/使用者等级/随机等级伤害、降目标 HP 至自身、亲密或不亲密威力、自身 HP 越高、目标比自身越快、树果类型威力、剩 PP 越少、自身 HP 越低、目标重量越大这些效果设 80；觉醒力量世代 ≤ 5 也设 80。**自身 HP 越高的效果先被设 150，后又被 80 覆盖，最终比较 80**，不能依注释写 150。其它保持数据威力，包括可能为 0 的变化招；没有候选则不展示。"}
00192: {"assertion_index":190,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L055","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":55,"full_assertion":"| FRISK | 仅玩家拥有者；对侧有持物者。世代 ≥ 6 逐个展示拥有者与物品；旧世代均匀选一个只报物品，无目标不展示；不检查物品当前能否生效 |"}
00193: {"assertion_index":191,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L079","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":79,"full_assertion":"ICEFACE 入场回调：EISCUE 且形态 1、有效冰雹时请求形态 0，本处理器不要求 switch_in 真；气体结束以默认假标志重调它时仍可恢复，实际形态提交还受 §9 通用门约束。IMPOSTER 则要求真实入场真、自己未变身，选择正对面，拒其倒下/变身/幻觉/替身/被天空摔投/半无敌，随后请求变身。变身不是隐式重新登记所有入场技能，局部提交见 §9。"}
00194: {"assertion_index":192,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L029","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":29,"full_assertion":"获得能力后置入口：持续检查（Trace 可再改能力，此处不立即重复触发它复制到的入场项）→ 当前能力的入场回调，实际入场标志为假 → 状态治疗检查 → 强天气结束检查。默认「入场回调」不等于真的换入：IMPOSTER 要求真实入场标志，因此此路径不变身。没有为所有后置路径补统一事务回滚；更早的能力赋值不会因后续无效果而撤销。"}
00195: {"assertion_index":193,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L039","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":39,"full_assertion":"| IMPOSTER 的变身提交 | 复制场上能力等后只调失去旧能力后置，未再调完整获得；见 §9 |"}
00196: {"assertion_index":194,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L254","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":254,"full_assertion":"IMPOSTER 变身请求：建立变身及复制物种记录，复制类型、能力、五项能力值、七阶级；新会心机制开时复制聚气/磨砺计数；替换场上招式各 PP 和总 PP 均 5，清禁用、复制重量变化、刷新展示，最后失去旧能力后置。没有直接复制目标 HP 或等级，没有把当前能力写回持久个体。全部变身/还原、其它形态插件与持久覆盖仍 WP22 主域。"}
00197: {"assertion_index":195,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L069","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":69,"full_assertion":"| INTIMIDATE | 逐存活且邻近的对侧请求降攻 1；具体前门与后置见下段 |"}
00198: {"assertion_index":196,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L081","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":81,"full_assertion":"NEUTRALIZINGGAS 到达入场回调后提示，遍历存活场上者：慢启动归 0、懒惰假；若无有效三种讲究物品则清锁招；有幻觉则清、非变身者恢复外观/已见。为比较紧张感压制前后，暂时将自身能力标识清空查询全局紧张感，再恢复气体；如果从有变无，对每个存活成员调用「紧张感结束」。该过程又速度序扫描全场树果，故可重复检查，不是一次去重全局通知。普通有效性对气体的持续压制由 WP48 负责，不由这条提示的出现次数决定。"}
00199: {"assertion_index":197,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L066","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":66,"full_assertion":"| PASTELVEIL | 入场回调治存活盟友真实中毒；自己由之后状态治疗入口治疗；无盟友中毒不展示 |"}
00200: {"assertion_index":198,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L067","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":67,"full_assertion":"| SCREENCLEANER | 依次对侧极光幕 → 光墙 → 反射壁，再己侧同序；每个正期限归 0 并提示，全部 0 不展示；不动其它屏障/保护 |"}
00201: {"assertion_index":199,"clause_id":"AI-REV-wp49-ability-phase-triggers-L068","path":"deliverables/final-specification-set/combat-requirements/wp49-ability-phase-triggers.md","line":68,"full_assertion":"| SLOWSTART | 每次到达该回调置计数 5 并提示；气体结束等重新触发也重置 5，回合末计数按 WP42/44 |"}
